<title>UK: Bell Cablemedia Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Bell Cablemedia Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Net loss		   49.7		   vs 19.5 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   46.2		   vs 16.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Net loss per American Depositary Share was 62p versus a loss of 31p.</p>
<p>The company attributed the increased net loss to higher depreciation and amortisation costs and increased interest expense.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 results include Videotron, which was acquired in December.</p>
<p>Bell Cablemedia Plc was one of the companies to be merged into Cable and Wireless Communications, a unit of Cable and Wireless Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
